8e4af314c44f817b9ca056"}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/oliverchang/osv-fork/git/commits/9805438dc8731dabd78c8b3eb6871cb12a5090b5", "comment_count": 0, "verification": {"verified": true, "reason": "valid", "signature": "-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsBcBAABCAAQBQJj/WUUCRBK7hj4Ov3rIwAA/L8IACvs4ShVZA4GpW9QGmIfNXPw\nqdageiq0jU1TwLM9n5Wo7fWWPujsrgFjQCkfGksBF/yNy1cs67jDx9PViQhnNsHd\n7h1AqQcOo5LQ7TiFnk5+UrQTjbD+lS5gr1VdITRKvG+KaqkgadupPAN4pSre2d/H\nSIiN8vooq2ZLGV8Q2/r95bihEEIhfpeT+ldVl8EoPt0wdgLBUe+Dw6bvcbe+ATye\nGjaQj4Ds6u/NIpiHdpEqpCxULNVs3dzNhP23DMVorbkq6cO4fF3fyMMzEorMKe7o\neB3LXC2gTFKMuWMJWVnFfeWpkMW00at3Kqg2olT6JjC26lqgdC4IJjO++bveaho=\n=sykc\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n", "payload": "tree bc404c9d790b80e83c8e4af314c44f817b9ca056\nparent 5f1dd174a06106acf6ad36f306bb9802d4e7c381\nauthor Michael Kedar <michaelkedar@google.com> 1677550868 +1100\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1677550868 +0000\n\nCloud Deploy and Automated `oss-vdb-test` Staging (#1065)\n\n- Two Cloud Deploy pipelines (`gke-workers` and `osv-api`) have been\r\ncreated in the `oss-vdb` project, with staging & production targets\r\n- The production targets are actually connected to production. **Please\r\ndon't press the promote button yet.** It should work but I haven't\r\nproperly checked it.\r\n- Automatically create releases for these pipelines on push to master,\r\nwhich deploys to `oss-vdb-test`.\r\n- Also automatically deploy App Engine to `oss-vdb-test` on push to\r\nmaster.\r\n- Tidied up some old and outdated deployment documentation.", "verified_at": "2024-01-16T19:59:59Z"}}, "url": "https://api.github.com/repos/oliverchang/osv-fork/commits/9805438dc8731dabd78c8b3eb6871cb12a5090b5", "html_url": "https://github.com/oliverchang/osv-fork/commit/9805438dc8731dabd78c8b3eb6871cb12a5090b5", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/oliverchang/osv-fork/commits/9805438dc8731dabd78c8b3eb6871cb12a5090b5/comments", "author": {"login": "michaelkedar", "id": 19356069, "node_id": "MDQ